ineering that is not engineering: fixed constraints, a fixed number of hands, and it has to survive being played outdoors by teenagers at full tempo.\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"dl\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-12 space-y-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"Wrote the music\\\",{\\\"data-reveal\\\":true,\\\"className\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"transitionDelay\\\":\\\"100ms\\\"},\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"dt\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-faint\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Wrote the music\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"dd\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-dim\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Battery music for all three movements of a field show, a cadence for battery and front ensemble, and six transcriptions. Drumline co-captain in 2023.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"Teach it\\\",{\\\"data-reveal\\\":true,\\\"className\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"transitionDelay\\\":\\\"160ms\\\"},\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"dt\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-faint\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Teach it\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"dd\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-dim\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Private instruction in drum set, drumline, and non-melodic percussion through Mirmina Music. In the first seven months, every student with no marching experience earned the placement they auditioned for.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"Still play\\\",{\\\"data-reveal\\\":true,\\\"className\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"transitionDelay\\\":\\\"220ms\\\"},\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"dt\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-faint\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Still play\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"dd\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-dim\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Purdue Varsity Band as a concert percussionist and soloist, and snare with the Boiler Bea