l-basketball league with my friends, and every score was being typed in by hand.\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-reveal\":true,\"className\":\"\",\"style\":{\"transitionDelay\":\"100ms\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-dim\",\"children\":\"One fixed camera watches the pool. The pipeline finds each shot, calls it a make or a miss, and is learning to say who took it. Identity comes from coloured swim caps, because people who are wet and half-submerged thirty feet away carry none of the cues a face model needs.\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-reveal\":true,\"className\":\"\",\"style\":{\"transitionDelay\":\"140ms\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"dl\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-10 gap-y-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"on shots it never saw in training\",{\"className\":\"max-w-[13rem]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-3xl leading-none\",\"children\":\"82.2%\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-ink-dim\",\"children\":\"on shots it never saw in training\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"shots judged by hand to train it\",{\"className\":\"max-w-[13rem]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-3xl leading-none\",\"children\":\"146\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-ink-dim\",\"children\":\"shots judged by hand to train it\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"of 4K footage recorded and labelled\",{\"className\":\"max-w-[13rem]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-3xl leading-none\",\"children\":\"118 min\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-ink-dim\",\"children\":\"of 4K footage recorded and labelled\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-reveal\":true,\"className\":\"\",\"style\":{\"transitionDelay\":\"180ms\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex fl